Risk: automatic old fixture activation, tool auto-exit, callbacks or task handles lost on reload, broad log suppression, stale roots, unsafe cleanup, menu collision/repeated run, incorrect material/audio ownership. Rollback only owned appended section against exact preserved prefix and fresh SHA/Operation; never HEAD/reset/clean/stash or unrelated dirty restoration. On compile/menu qualification failure keep first evidence and stop downstream; do not switch to forbidden execute_code or UTR.

Prior process-parameter collection incident: exec_command used PowerShell Get-CimInstance to read a process-parameter field in the preceding preparation. That collection is stopped; its observation is withdrawn as P1 authority. No original parameter values/command/environment/raw are reproduced or queried.
